# CAOS has no BR2_EXTERNAL target or host packages of its own.
#
# The UEFI bootloader is Buildroot's GRUB2 EFI package; the kernel, rootfs,
# ESP and GPT image are configured directly in configs/caos_defconfig and
# board/caos/.  This file is intentionally kept because BR2_EXTERNAL expects
# a Config.in entry point.
